 wake  of the death of george floyd  we must put an end to racism and we must  ensure that any police officer who  abuses their powers  is held accountable what happened to  george floyd is a disgrace and if you  know a police officer you know they  agree with that too  and at the same time the 42 year old  praised the work of police officers  arguing the importance of law and order  we cannot lose sight of the fact that  our police are american heroes  they deserve our deepest appreciation  because no matter what the democrats say  you and i both know  when we dial 9-1-1 we don't want it  going to voicemail  so defunding the police is not an option  he went on to praise his dad's  administration  particularly trump's response to the  coronavirus  he spent a lot of a speech detailing the  differences in policies and practices  between his dad and democratic  presidential candidate joe biden  he painted a bleak picture of what he  thinks the biden presidency  might look like biden's radical  left-wing policies  would stop our economic recovery cold  he's already talking about shutting the  country down  again it's madness and while many celebs  took  jabs at kimberly and trump jr outspoken  conservative commentators praised a  speech from former football star  herschel walker i watched him treat  janitors  security guards and waiters the same way  he retreated vip  he made them feel special because he  knew they were  herschel spoke about his longtime  friendship with the president  and vouched for his integrity if you  love america and want to make it better  donald trump is your president he's my  president  and i'm blessed to call him friend
 

